---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Cookie Policy — Orbit Web Designs & Marketing" description="Orbit Web Designs & Marketing Cookie Policy — how we use cookies and tracking technologies.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-8">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. What Are Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site function, remember preferences, and provide analytics.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Cookies We Use</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-slate-300 border border-edge/30 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-charcoal/50 border-b border-edge/30">
              <th class="p-4 text-left font-semibold text-white">Category</th>
              <th class="p-4 text-left font-semibold text-white">Purpose</th>
              <th class="p-4 text-left font-semibold text-white">Examples</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-edge/30">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-white">Essential</td>
              <td class="p-4">Site functionality, security, session management</td>
              <td class="p-4">Session ID, CSRF token, load balancing</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-white">Analytics</td>
              <td class="p-4">Understand how visitors use our site</td>
              <td class="p-4">Google Analytics (_ga, _gid), Meta Pixel (_fbp)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-white">Marketing</td>
              <td class="p-4">Measure ad effectiveness, retargeting</td>
              <td class="p-4">Meta Pixel (_fbp, _fbc), Google Ads</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-white">Functional</td>
              <td class="p-4">Remember preferences, improve UX</td>
              <td class="p-4">Language, theme, form data</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> _ga, _gid, _gat — 26 months retention</li>
          <li><strong>Meta Pixel:</strong> _fbp, _fbc — 90 days retention</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> No cookies, but font requests logged</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> Click-to-chat links may set cookies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Your Choices</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Browser settings: block/delete cookies</li>
          <li>Opt-out of Google Analytics: <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-electric hover:underline" target="_blank">GA Opt-out Add-on</a></li>
          <li>Opt-out of Meta ads: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences/" class="text-electric hover:underline" target="_blank">Meta Ad Preferences</a></li>
          <li>Browser settings: block third-party cookies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Consent</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">By using our site, you consent to essential cookies. Analytics and marketing cookies require your consent (implied by continued use with browser settings allowing them).</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Changes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">We may update this policy. Continued use constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:mwmwai@gmail.com" class="text-electric hover:underline">mwmwai@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254741992308" class="text-electric hover:underline">0741 992 308</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>